  "$comment": "Shared BIP44 safe child-derivation golden vectors: byte-identical to packages/wallet-platform/test/unit/base/safes/fixtures/safeBip44Vectors.json. Scheme: the safe user child derives at the hardened path m/44'/<coinType>'/<slot>'/<account>' and the multisig co-signers at its soft twin m/44/<coinType>/<slot>/<account>, where <coinType> is the statics bip44CoinType of the coin family and <slot> is the statics SAFE_ROOT_SLOT_ORDINALS value of the root slot. Every root is a published public test vector (the BIP32 test vectors 1/2/3 seeds and the SLIP-0010-style StrKey seed SAAACAQDAQCQMBYIBEFAWDANBYHRAEISCMKBKFQXDAMRUGY4DUPB6NKI, raw seed 000102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f101112131415161718191a1b1c1d1e1f), so both repos reproduce every value without sharing secrets. A divergent implementation mints co-signer keys nobody else can reproduce, permanently bricking the wallets minted with it.",
